# Website apply loop (shared)

When starting Upwork, Mostaql, or employment-site apply loops, or when the user requests browser automation for an application:

1. Read [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md)
2. Read [`.agents/skills/candidate-source.md`](../../.agents/skills/candidate-source.md) and the current `resume.tex`
3. Load and follow [`.agents/skills/website-apply-loop/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/website-apply-loop/SKILL.md)
4. Follow [`.agents/skills/browser-session/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/browser-session/SKILL.md); never bypass its dedicated-profile helper.
5. Candidate facts come only from the current master `.tex`.
